---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure | Access Free Tools"
  description="Learn how Access Free Tools handles advertising, affiliate links, product callouts, and sponsored relationships."
  path="/advertising-disclosure/"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Advertising Disclosure</p>
    <h1>Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Tools stay free. Ads and affiliate links may help support the site when they are added.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section content-section-narrow legal-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> April 30, 2026</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Access Free Tools may display ads, including ads served by Google AdSense or other ad
      partners. Ads should be visually separate from calculator controls and guide content. We do
      not want fake ad boxes or placeholders on the site before an ad network is actually approved
      and connected.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some future pages may include affiliate links to products related to a tool or guide. I may
      earn a commission if you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, at no extra cost to you.
      For example, a calculator guide may later mention a related design or product from a
      print-on-demand store.
    </p>

    <h2>Where disclosures should appear</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate disclosures should appear close to affiliate links or product previews, not only on
      this page. If a blog post recommends or promotes a product, that page should clearly explain
      the financial connection before or near the link.
    </p>

    <h2>Tool independence</h2>
    <p>
      Ads, affiliate links, and product previews do not change calculator formulas or tool results.
      You do not need to click an ad or buy a product to use Access Free Tools.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party stores</h2>
    <p>
      Product prices, stock, shipping, refunds, sizing, fulfillment, and customer support are handled
      by the third-party store or marketplace. Check the seller's own policies before buying.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For advertising or affiliate disclosure questions, use the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      page or email <a href="mailto:contact@accessfreetools.com">contact@accessfreetools.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
